    "%lld still working" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 个仍在工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld waiting on you" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 个在等你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "<1m" : {
      "comment" : "Less than one minute left",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "<1分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A background helper" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个后台助手"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup to the per-agent setup: while Adrafinil is already keeping your Mac awake for one agent, it can also notice other known agents (like a second Claude Code) running without their hook installed. It only runs while an agent is already active — never a background scan — so it costs nothing while your Mac is idle or asleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是逐个 Agent 设置的后备方案：当 Adrafinil 已在为某个 Agent 保持 Mac 唤醒时，它还能留意到其他未安装钩子但正在运行的已知 Agent（比如第二个 Claude Code）。它只在已有 Agent 活跃时运行——从不在后台扫描——因此 Mac 空闲或睡眠时没有任何开销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A display hold is active but the lid is closed with no other display — the agent behind it can't see the screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示器唤醒锁已启用，但盖子已合上且没有其他显示器——发起它的 Agent 看不到屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A menu bar app" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个菜单栏 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer version of Adrafinil is out. See what's new and install it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 有新版本了。查看新功能并安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer version of Adrafinil is ready when you are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 的新版本已就绪，随时可以安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A question, a plan approval, or a permission prompt stops the work until you answer — but the question can be answered from your phone with Remote Control, which needs the Mac awake to receive it. The grace period keeps it reachable exactly that long; if nobody answers, your Mac sleeps, and the moment the session resumes Adrafinil protects it again. The menu shows a countdown while it waits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提问、计划审批或权限请求会让工作暂停，直到你回答——但你可以通过 Remote Control 在手机上回答，这需要 Mac 保持唤醒才能接收。宽限期会让 Mac 在这段时间内保持可连接；如果无人回答，Mac 就会睡眠，而会话一旦恢复，Adrafinil 会立即再次保护它。等待期间，菜单中会显示倒计时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ADRAFINIL" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add these to your agent's start and stop hooks. Replace %@ with your agent's session-id variable, so each turn's acquire and release share a key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将这些添加到 Agent 的开始和停止钩子中。把 %@ 替换为 Agent 的会话 ID 变量，让每轮的 acquire 和 release 使用同一个键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your own agent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加你自己的 Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds Adrafinil as an MCP tool in %@, so it can keep your Mac awake for work that runs past its reply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 Adrafinil 作为 MCP 工具添加到 %@，让它能在回复结束后为仍在运行的工作保持 Mac 唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds Adrafinil as an MCP tool in %@, so the agent can keep your Mac awake for work that runs past its reply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 Adrafinil 作为 MCP 工具添加到 %@，让该 Agent 能在回复结束后为仍在运行的工作保持 Mac 唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil Setup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 设置向导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil checks GitHub Releases once a day and tells you here and in the menu when a new version is out. Nothing downloads or installs until you choose Update Now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 每天检查一次 GitHub Releases，有新版本时会在这里和菜单中告诉你。在你选择“立即更新”之前，不会下载或安装任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil checks GitHub Releases once a day and verifies every download's code signature. Updates install themselves when your Mac is idle and no agents are being kept awake — or right away with Update Now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 每天检查一次 GitHub Releases，并验证每个下载的代码签名。更新会在你的 Mac 空闲且没有 Agent 需要保持唤醒时自动安装——也可以点按“立即更新”马上安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil chime" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 提示音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil couldn't clean up everywhere — remove these by hand, or the agent will keep calling a command that no longer exists:\n\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 未能清理所有位置——请手动移除以下内容，否则 Agent 会一直调用一个已不存在的命令：\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil cue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 提示音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil is running from a temporary location (macOS translocation). Setting up from here would point everything at a path that disappears on the next launch. Move Adrafinil.app to your Applications folder, then open it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 正在从临时位置运行（macOS 路径随机化）。从这里设置会让所有配置指向一个下次启动时就会消失的路径。请将 Adrafinil.app 移到“应用程序”文件夹，然后重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil is set up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已设置完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil isn't keeping your Mac awake" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 没有在让你的 Mac 保持唤醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil isn't set up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 尚未设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil keeps it awake while your agents work — a desktop still sleeps on idle and would stall a long task. Lid and battery features are hidden because there's no lid or battery to manage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 会在你的 Agent 工作时让它保持唤醒——台式机空闲时仍会睡眠，可能会中断长时间的任务。由于没有盖子或电池需要管理，相关功能已隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil keeps your Mac awake — even with the lid closed — while your AI agents work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你的 AI Agent 工作时，Adrafinil 会让你的 Mac 保持唤醒——即使合上盖子也一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil kept your Mac awake" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 让你的 Mac 保持了唤醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil let it sleep to cool down (it peaked at %lld°C). %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 让它进入睡眠以降温（最高达到 %lld°C）。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil let it sleep to cool down. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 让它进入睡眠以降温。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil let your Mac sleep to save power. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 让你的 Mac 进入睡眠以节省电量。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil needs your approval" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 需要你的批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil updated itself at a quiet moment — here's what changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已在空闲时自动更新——以下是更改内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adrafinil updated itself at a quiet moment. See what's new." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adrafinil 已在空闲时自动更新。查看新功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
