    },
    "Agent holds" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 唤醒锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents can't keep your Mac awake until you resume" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你恢复之前，Agent 无法让你的 Mac 保持唤醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents finished" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 已完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents that run as one shared background service, like Hermes, aren't picked up this way — connect them in the Agents tab so their hooks can signal when they're actually working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以共享后台服务形式运行的 Agent（如 Hermes）无法通过这种方式发现——请在“Agent”标签页中连接它们，让它们的钩子告知何时真正在工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All set — Codex will keep your Mac awake while it works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切就绪——Codex 工作时会让你的 Mac 保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent can ask Adrafinil to keep your Mac awake for a background task it started — like a long build or deploy — even after it finishes replying. Every hold has a time limit and shows up in the menu, where you can end it yourself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 可以请求 Adrafinil 为它启动的后台任务（比如耗时的构建或部署）保持 Mac 唤醒，即使它已结束回复。每个唤醒锁都有时间上限，并显示在菜单中，你可以在那里自行结束它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve Adrafinil's two hooks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "批准 Adrafinil 的两个钩子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
