    "Click the menu-bar sun icon to see the real popover, or watch the preview →" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Close eye" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Codex needs you to trust its hooks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codex 需要你信任它的钩子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex only runs hooks you've approved. Until you trust Adrafinil's, Codex won't tell it when a turn starts or ends — so your Mac may sleep mid-task, or stay awake after Codex is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codex 只会运行你批准过的钩子。在你信任 Adrafinil 的钩子之前，Codex 不会告诉它一轮对话何时开始或结束——你的 Mac 可能会在任务中途睡眠，或在 Codex 完成后仍保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex won't run these hooks until you trust them. Open Codex, run “/hooks”, and approve Adrafinil's acquire and release entries — otherwise it can't tell when Codex is working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你信任这些钩子之前，Codex 不会运行它们。打开 Codex，运行“/hooks”，并批准 Adrafinil 的 acquire 和 release 条目——否则它无法得知 Codex 何时在工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Config unreadable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置无法读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect each agent so Adrafinil knows when it's working and keeps your Mac awake only then. Some agents can also keep it awake on their own — for a build or deploy that runs past their reply. You can change all of this later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接每个 Agent，让 Adrafinil 知道它何时在工作，并仅在那时让你的 Mac 保持唤醒。有些 Agent 还能自行保持唤醒——用于在回复结束后仍在运行的构建或部署。这些都可以稍后在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect your agents" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接你的 Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
