    "System Settings → Login Items & Extensions just opened. Turn **Adrafinil** on under “Allow in the Background,” then come back and click Continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“系统设置”→“登录项与扩展”已经打开。在“允许在后台”下打开 **Adrafinil**，然后回到这里点按“继续”。"
