            "value" : "就是你现在看到的这些控件——它的窗口从菜单栏打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The low-battery cutout fired — acquires are paused until charging resumes or the lid opens." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "低电量保护已触发——在恢复充电或打开盖子之前，暂停接受新的唤醒请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sleep block couldn't be fully applied — your Mac may still sleep when the lid closes. Retrying." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法完全阻止睡眠——合上盖子时 Mac 仍可能睡眠。正在重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The thermal cutout fired — acquires are paused until the Mac cools down or the lid opens." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过热保护已触发——在 Mac 降温或打开盖子之前，暂停接受新的唤醒请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update couldn't be installed. Try again, or get it from the releases page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法安装更新。请重试，或从发布页面获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their Adrafinil hooks changed, so your Mac might not stay awake while they work. Open Settings to reconnect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们的 Adrafinil 钩子已更改，因此它们工作时你的 Mac 可能不会保持唤醒。打开“设置”以重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal cutout" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过热保护"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These apply when an agent is still working as you close the lid — a sound to confirm your Mac is staying awake, and a locked screen to keep it private." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置在你合上盖子时仍有 Agent 在工作的情况下生效——用声音确认 Mac 保持唤醒，并锁定屏幕以保护隐私。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This disconnects Adrafinil from all your agents, turns off its background services, and removes the adrafinil command and its settings. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将断开 Adrafinil 与你所有 Agent 的连接，关闭其后台服务，并移除 adrafinil 命令及其设置。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This looks like a desktop Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这似乎是一台台式 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This release shipped without notes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本没有附带更新说明。"
          }
        }
      }
