    "Tracked as %@ in Adrafinil" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Adrafinil 中显示为 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trust Adrafinil in Codex" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Codex 中信任 Adrafinil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trust the entries that run **adrafinil acquire** (on prompt submit) and **adrafinil release** (on stop). They're listed under your hooks file; approving each is a one-time step." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "信任运行 **adrafinil acquire**（提交提示词时）和 **adrafinil release**（停止时）的条目。它们列在你的钩子文件下，每个只需批准一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Adrafinil on under “Allow in the Background” so it can keep your Mac awake while agents work. If it won't turn on, try Repair." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“允许在后台”下打开 Adrafinil，让它能在 Agent 工作时保持 Mac 唤醒。如果无法打开，请尝试修复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn an agent on and Adrafinil keeps your Mac awake while it's working, then lets it sleep again when the agent stops. Turn it off to disconnect. Some agents can also keep your Mac awake on their own — that adds Adrafinil as an MCP tool they can call." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开某个 Agent 后，Adrafinil 会在它工作时让你的 Mac 保持唤醒，并在它停止后让 Mac 恢复睡眠。关闭即可断开连接。有些 Agent 还能自行让 Mac 保持唤醒——这会将 Adrafinil 添加为它们可以调用的 MCP 工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
