    "What's New…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新功能…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's new in %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的新功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Claude Code asks you something" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 Claude Code 向你提问时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an agent runs a shell command in the background — a long build or test run it keeps going after replying — this keeps your Mac awake for it. There's no signal when such a command finishes, so the hold lasts up to your longest-hold limit above (even if the task itself goes quiet, like a “tail -f”) and then ends on its own. Works with Claude Code. Off by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 Agent 在后台运行 Shell 命令（比如在回复后仍继续运行的耗时构建或测试）时，此选项会为其保持 Mac 唤醒。这类命令结束时不会发出信号，因此唤醒锁会持续到上方设置的最长时间（即使任务本身已无输出，比如“tail -f”），然后自动结束。适用于 Claude Code。默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When sleep resumes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复睡眠时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the last agent finishes while the lid is closed, Adrafinil plays a cue just before your Mac goes back to sleep — so you know it's done without opening the lid. Each reason can have its own sound; the volume above applies." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "合盖期间最后一个 Agent 完成时，Adrafinil 会在 Mac 恢复睡眠前播放提示音——无需打开盖子就知道已经完成。每种原因可以设置各自的声音，音量沿用上方的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you close the lid" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "合上盖子时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
